The CAD you released establishes that event SP26097765 occurred in your dis=
patch system. The event shows a unit dispatched at 08:41:32, arriving at 09=
:50:02, and cleared at 10:18:42, after roughly sixty-nine minutes of travel=
 each direction. Three vehicles
 and multiple officers were involved; two Oregon State Police officers were=
 at my door, and I have the plate of one departing vehicle, 731 QRV, which =
does not correspond to the single unit named in the CAD.</div>
<div style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Robot=
o, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" dir=
